{"seq":3,"slug":"exercise-physiology","title":"运动生理学","stage":"DONE","category":"health-medicine","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology","rating":{"composite":3.97,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.75,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 运动生理学 简介\n\n运动生理学是研究人体在运动负荷下产生的结构、功能及代谢适应变化的学科。它揭示了从分子水平的肌肉收缩机制，到整体水平的心肺协调供能，再到长期训练引发的系统性适应这一完整链条。\n\n本知识库面向希望从科学角度理解运动、指导自身训练的学习者。无论你是想提升跑步耐力、增加力量，还是优化恢复策略，运动生理学都能提供底层逻辑支撑。\n\n本知识库包含四个章节：\n\n第一章**肌肉生理学**系统讲解骨骼肌的微观结构、纤维类型分类、收缩-舒张的分子机制，以及力量训练引发的肌肉肥大与神经适应。\n\n第二章**心肺系统与运动**聚焦于心脏在运动中的即时响应与长期重塑，包括最大摄氧量、心脏输出量、呼吸力学以及耐力训练带来的心肺适应。\n\n第三章**运动能量系统**深入三大供能通路——磷酸原系统、糖酵解系统和有氧氧化系统，解析不同运动强度和持续时间下的能量动员策略。\n\n第四章**训练原则与恢复**整合超负荷、特异性、周期化等经典训练原则，并结合恢复生理学、过度训练综合征识别与睡眠-营养-恢复的协同关系。\n\n推荐学习路径：先从第一章建立肌肉收缩的微观认知，再进入第二章理解心肺如何为肌肉供氧，接着第三章把握能量代谢全貌，最后在第四章将知识整合为可执行的训练策略。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"muscle-physiology","title":"肌肉生理学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/muscle-physiology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"skeletal-muscle-structure-and-fiber-types","title":"骨骼肌结构与肌纤维类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/muscle-physiology/skeletal-muscle-structure-and-fiber-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"muscle-contraction-mechanisms","title":"肌肉收缩机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/muscle-physiology/muscle-contraction-mechanisms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"muscle-adaptation-and-hypertrophy","title":"肌肉适应与肥大","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/muscle-physiology/muscle-adaptation-and-hypertrophy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"cardiovascular-respiratory","title":"心肺系统与运动","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/cardiovascular-respiratory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cardiac-output-and-exercise-response","title":"心输出量与运动应答","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/cardiovascular-respiratory/cardiac-output-and-exercise-response"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vo2max-and-aerobic-capacity","title":"最大摄氧量与有氧能力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/cardiovascular-respiratory/vo2max-and-aerobic-capacity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"respiratory-mechanics-during-exercise","title":"运动中的呼吸力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/cardiovascular-respiratory/respiratory-mechanics-during-exercise"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"energy-systems-and-metabolism","title":"运动能量系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/energy-systems-and-metabolism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"atp-pcr-and-phosphagen-system","title":"ATP-PCr 与磷酸原系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/energy-systems-and-metabolism/atp-pcr-and-phosphagen-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"glycolytic-system-and-lactate","title":"糖酵解系统与乳酸代谢","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/energy-systems-and-metabolism/glycolytic-system-and-lactate"},{"seq":3,"slug":"aerobic-oxidation-and-fat-metabolism","title":"有氧氧化与脂肪代谢","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/energy-systems-and-metabolism/aerobic-oxidation-and-fat-metabolism"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"training-principles-and-recovery","title":"训练原则与恢复","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/training-principles-and-recovery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"overload-specificity-and-periodization","title":"超负荷、特异性与周期化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/training-principles-and-recovery/overload-specificity-and-periodization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"recovery-physiology-and-supercompensation","title":"恢复生理学与超补偿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/training-principles-and-recovery/recovery-physiology-and-supercompensation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"overtraining-syndrome-and-prevention","title":"过度训练综合征与预防","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/training-principles-and-recovery/overtraining-syndrome-and-prevention"}]}]}